cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this georeferenced spatial benchmark layer, please cite it."
title: "Georeferenced IEEE 30-bus spatial layer"
version: "0.1.0-pre-release"
date-released: 2026-10-11
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Sohrabi
    given-names: Behrouz
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A project-authored, synthetic georeferencing and spatial benchmark layer for
  the IEEE 30-bus test system. It contains bus coordinates, branch routes,
  stable identifiers, topology crosswalk fields, provenance, and validation
  metadata for reproducible spatial-method benchmarking.
keywords:
  - IEEE 30-bus
  - georeferenced power systems
  - wildfire-grid benchmark
  - GeoJSON
  - reproducibility
repository-code: "https://github.com/BehrouzSohrabi/georeferenced-ieee30-wildfire-benchmark"
